# Time Log

A recorded interval of work on one task or one defect.

◇

attributes:
    - key: cycle
      name: Cycle
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: start_time
      name: Start Time
      rules: datetime
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: stop_time
      name: Stop Time
      rules: datetime
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: interruption_minutes
      name: Interruption Minutes
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 minute"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: comments
      name: Comments
      rules: unconstrained
      type_spec: STRING
